{"parse":{"title":"技能图鉴库/匠心","pageid":6465,"revid":14739,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%8C%A0%E5%BF%83&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%8C%A0%E5%BF%83&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%8C%A0%E5%BF%83&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>匠心</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E5.8C.A0.E5.BF.83\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"匠心\"><b>匠心</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E7%AE%80%E5%8D%95%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\">技能详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\"><img alt=\"技能 匠心.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/09/gh46qa84tvu83cmi6k73eqz22en9l83.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%8C%A0%E5%BF%83.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/09/gh46qa84tvu83cmi6k73eqz22en9l83.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%8C%A0%E5%BF%83.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/0/09/gh46qa84tvu83cmi6k73eqz22en9l83.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />匠心\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><center><b>&#160;技能类别<br /></b>[职业技能]</center>\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\">&#160;\n<p>（被动）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"光棱晶石\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">光棱晶石</font></span></span>]在技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">重构•镜反</font></span>]释放时，获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">叶伽内</span>]额外获得的所有效果；当拥有<font color=\"#ed7950\">10</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"解放\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">解放</font></span></span>]并释放该技能时，[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"光棱晶石\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">光棱晶石</font></span></span>]额外获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>次[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"偏斜\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">偏斜</font></span></span>]。<br />✦[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"光棱晶石\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">光棱晶石</font></span></span>]拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"免伤\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">免伤</font></span></span>]系列时，可使其效果翻倍；行动结束或被攻击时触发的[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"晶棱折射\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">晶棱折射</font></span></span>]伤害倍率下降<font color=\"#ed7950\">15%</font>，可产生<font color=\"#58cb48\">20%</font>[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"生命汲取\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">生命汲取</font></span></span>]。\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div>\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%8F%B6%E8%BF%A6%E5%86%85\" title=\"角色图鉴库/叶迦内\"><img alt=\"头像 叶迦内.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/b/bc/pqec6mc2vv7z2ocf2sl1l6sgwdt96ny.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">叶迦内</font></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div>\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\">关联内容\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022164108\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.464 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.614 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 10086/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 162861/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8534/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 13/40\nExpensive parser functio